{"strongs": "H4132", "word": "מוֺט", "translit": "mot", "root": "מוד", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun [masculine]", "gloss": "shaking, pole, bar of yoke", "definition": "מוֺט noun [masculine] shaking, pole, bar of yoke ; — absolute ׳ מ Num 4:10 + 5 t.; suffix מֹטֵ֫הוּ Nah 1:13 — 1. a shaking; tottering (c. negative, of security) לַצַּדִּיק לֹאיִֿתֵּן ׳ מ Ps 55:23 רַגְלֵנוּ ׳ לֹא נָתַן לַמ Ps 66:9 , compare Ps 121:3 . 2. pole , or bar for carrying (named from springing motion) Num 4:10 ; Num 4:12 compare especially Num 13:23 . 3. bar of yoke Nah 1:13 ( אֶשְׁבֹּר מֹטֵהוּ מֵעָלַיַךְ ), figurative of oppression. compare following.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4543')\">BDB4543</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4132')\">H4132</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4542')\">BDB4542</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4544')\">BDB4544</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מוֺט</bdbheb> <b>noun [masculine]</b> <highlightword>shaking, pole, bar of yoke</highlightword>; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 4:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,10)\">Num 4:10</ref> + 5 t.; suffix <bdbheb>מֹטֵ֫הוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Nah 1:13\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(34,1,13)\">Nah 1:13</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>a shaking; tottering</highlight> (c. negative, of security) <bdbheb>לַצַּדִּיק לֹאיִֿתֵּן</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 55:23\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"55\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"55\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(19,55,23)\">Ps 55:23</ref> <bdbheb>רַגְלֵנוּ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לֹא נָתַן לַמ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 66:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,66,9)\">Ps 66:9</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Ps 121:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"121\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"121\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,121,3)\">Ps 121:3</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>pole</highlight>, or <highlight>bar</highlight> for carrying (named from springing motion) <ref ref=\"Num 4:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,10)\">Num 4:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 4:12\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(4,4,12)\">Num 4:12</ref> compare especially <ref ref=\"Num 13:23\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,23)\">Num 13:23</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>bar</highlight> of yoke <ref ref=\"Nah 1:13\" b=\"34\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(34,1,13)\">Nah 1:13</ref> (<bdbheb>אֶשְׁבֹּר מֹטֵהוּ מֵעָלַיַךְ</bdbheb>), figurative of oppression. compare following. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Num 4:10", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 4, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Nah 1:13", "book": "NAM", "chapter": 1, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Ps 55:23", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 55, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Ps 66:9", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 66, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ps 121:3", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 121, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Num 4:12", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 4, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Num 13:23", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 13, "verse": 23}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["מוֺט", "׳", "מ", "מֹטֵ֫הוּ", "לַצַּדִּיק לֹאיִֿתֵּן", "רַגְלֵנוּ", "לֹא נָתַן לַמ", "אֶשְׁבֹּר מֹטֵהוּ מֵעָלַיַךְ"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": []}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB4543", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}